window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Adventure, action and dark humor galore, delivered Ralph Cotton style, in his fictional take on the real-life DEA - FBI joint Operation Swordfish, a covert effort launched by the two agencies in the early 1980s. </p> <p>Meet Eddie Vango - Chicago gambling debt collector for the Outfit, the lovely Leslie Wright, and ex-con Delbert Moss as they make their way through the ranks of South Florida Drug Lords and take a giant share of the underworld’s operating capital while the drug world is busy 'replacing' its leadership. </p> <p>Performed by Colleen Delany, Joel David Santer, Laura C. Harris, Daniel Llaca, Alejandro Ruiz, Ian Russell, Nazia Chaudhry, Gabriel Michael, Michael John Casey, Rob McFadyen, James Konicek, Rayner Gabriel, Scott McCormick, Brad Smith, Mike Ciporkin, Joe Mallon, Tyler Hyrchuk, James Lewis, Christopher Graybill, Kaylee Eluvian, Brandon Burton, Chris Stinson, Nanette Savard, and Holly Adams.</p>"; 
